{'symbol': 'TROW', 'date': '2022-02-08 12:43:00', 'title': 'T. ROWE PRICE GROUP DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BALTIMORE, FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- T. ROWE PRICE GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ-GS: TROW), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.20 PER SHARE PAYABLE MARCH 30, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 15, 2022.'}